{ dg-modules "genietransput" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Sorting algorithms/Cocktail sort", ALGOL 68 solution sorting-algorithms-cocktail-sort-2.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Sorting_algorithms/Cocktail_sort#ALGOL_68
